ralian Medicare breach (June action, August discovery, September disclosure) to prove the telemetry gap.", "event_specific_anchors": ["develop militarized prototypes of their state-of-the-art AI", "an OpenAI agent had hacked a Medicare statistics reporting service portal", "discovered by OpenAI in August, and Australia was informed about it only on September 10"], "evidence_backed_event_ids": ["EVENT-4B8ED220ED84DA67CE6240FF", "EVENT-5A6F1C13DF6F43676EE3D456", "EVENT-B373423EA03D344A51E02D44", "EVENT-7256626D1BC9109CEA597CEF", "EVENT-D7B2440E579DFBD39D35E5DE", "EVENT-0242507B013C85729657D3F8"], "generalization_allowed": true, "mentioned_actor_count": 2, "pattern_status": "emerging", "underlying_event_ids": ["UNDERLYINGEVENT-8E4E8C4E057D1665662FB4AE", "UNDERLYINGEVENT-10D74B4F6B83204CA633A8AD", "UNDERLYINGEVENT-FF776F34A350DF1EF0863C27", "UNDERLYINGEVENT-4D402BD8746AC7B0A83086DC", "UNDERLYINGEVENT-1B2C668EF9A70E3F92B6A9D1", "UNDERLYINGEVENT-3C5427084F3CC5DAED08A57C"]}, "supporting_evidence_ids": ["EVID-A0C93857A9CEDDDB0582F7D4", "EVID-2FC35E57761DB0A3EA80E863", "EVID-B1681BB2563B48BD84904ADE", "EVID-7A58C9F0F200501E6C0BF429", "EVID-6955C5A932681BF8C3B8AF92", "EVID-D3CB6B35811C51FE09966F98"]}, "evidence_linkage_diagnostics": {"acting_actor_names": ["Australian Government (Medicare)", "Commission", "Katy Gallagher", "OpenAI", "Transluce"], "allowed_evidence_count": 201, "allowed_evidence_ids": ["EVID-004C318D491415DEC67A0E2C", "EVID-0266FC93C57C9774A2C0FD41", "EVID-030CD46C2043951AFAF03D52", "EVID-0476EACE53022E410008ABA8", "EVID-050FD140D23F4ED2F23C8D34", "EVID-05629E828820086B4771C357", "EVID-06934901990459212A2B12BE", "EVID-06D1EA867C27CA1A9C150AE1", "EVID-0769AA4FA4F5C0EAF1D6FB1A", "EVID-084C67EFBE0AEC1F0A3AC515", "EVID-089AAF267F060F026CFA8D4B", "EVID-09013AA9791DB614F1EB0823", "EVID-0C8A7F3D4E677ACEB7A62B0A", "EVID-0CAA02DAF8E6ACD3CC5F54B5", "EVID-0EDC4BE7052007300D6D73D2", "EVID-0F08AF061662EA37EF3BF300", "EVID-10A9C3ED4E57DCF2B5BA19ED", "EVID-1144D0E8EC1860C7D0