 the artificial intelligence being spoken of so much now,\" he said. In the address, Trump instead referred to AI as \"super intelligence,\" arguing that the term artificial \"makes it sound fake, and it is not fake. In his address on Tuesday, Trump rejected the notion, saying whoever masters the technology first wins.", "raw_actor_fields": {"acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "organisation": null, "organization": null, "primary_actor": "Donald Trump", "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"entity_type": "person", "mention": "Donald Trump", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"], "role": "actor"}, {"entity_type": "unknown", "mention": "artificial intelligence", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"], "role": "object"}], "resolved_primary_actor": "Donald Trump", "source_id": "SOURCE-357916E6FC17B3F16C523F2F"}, {"admission_reasons": [], "admission_status": "considered", "diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "event_id": "EVENT-3034B5E6CAA77B5590C0A9BC", "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "strategic_theme", "strategic_time_window", "strategic_topic_linkage_type", "strategic_topic_relevance_score", "summary", "